 Deze onafhankelijke kunstruimte geeft kunstenaars de ruimte om een eigen presentatie te ontwikkelen. Experimentele tentoonstellingen nodigen uit tot nieuwsgierigheid en onverwachte manieren van kijken.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","experiment","kunsthal"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"25a789aa-77b3-5c6c-9d10-e9dae2d50c95","inventory_key":"art-audit:z2","name":"38CC","city":"Delft","province":"Zuid-Holland","street_address":"Papenstraat 5","postal_code":"2611 JB","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.38cc.nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek hedendaagse kunst op persoonlijke schaal bij 38CC. Wisselende tentoonstellingen brengen verschillende kunstenaars en benaderingen samen. Gesprekken en andere activiteiten geven extra ruimte aan ontmoeting met het werk.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","kunsthal"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Delft_-_Papenstraat_5-7.jpg/1280px-Delft_-_Papenstraat_5-7.jpg","caption":"38CC — Delft - Papenstraat 5-7","credit":"Michiel1972","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Delft_-_Papenstraat_5-7.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"53a4ea87-3364-548c-ae48-56b78a1d3eb5","inventory_key":"art-audit:z3","name":"A Tale of a Tub","city":"Rotterdam","province":"Zuid-Holland","street_address":"Justus van Effenstraat 44","postal_code":"3027 TK","country":"NL","website_url":"https://a-tub.org","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek kunst in het voormalige badhuis van het Justus van Effencomplex. A Tale of a Tub verbindt tentoonstellingen met onderzoek en verhalen uit de omgeving. Het programma laat kunst en dagelijks leven op elkaar reageren.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","kunsthal"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Justus_van_Effen_Complex_2.jpg/1280px-Justus_van_Effen_Complex_2.jpg","caption":"A Tale of a Tub — Justus van Effen Complex 2","credit":"Ymblanter","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Justus_van_Effen_Complex_2.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"b0e3929f-652d-5fa9-83de-36afa06e5636","inventory_key":"art-audit:z7","name":"Beautiful Distress House","city":"Amsterdam","province":"Noord-Holland","street_address":"Ms. Van Riemsdijkweg 41A","postal_code":"1033 RM","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.beautifuldistress.org/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek kunst die de ervaring van psychische kwetsbaarheid bespreekbaar maakt. Beautiful Distress geeft kunstenaars ruimte om daar eigen beelden en verhalen voor te vinden. Tentoonstellingen nodigen uit tot aandacht, herkenning en gesprek.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","maatschappij","kunsthal"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"5caab58f-9a36-5b74-b22c-1147054e0037","inventory_key":"art-audit:z9","name":"CAMPIS podium voor hedendaagse kunst","city":"Assen","province":"Drenthe","street_address":"Kerkstraat 31","postal_code":"9401 GV","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.campis.nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek actuele beeldende kunst bij CAMPIS in Assen. Wisselende tentoonstellingen geven kunstenaars ruimte voor nieuwe perspectieven op mens en omgeving. De toegankelijke schaal maakt het gemakkelijk om rustig te kijken en door te vragen.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","kunsthal"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"9b52f710-dd7e-5428-bfce-f535533ac528","inventory_key":"art-audit:z10","name":"Casco Art Institute: Working for the Commons","city":"Utrecht","province":"Utrecht","street_address":"Lange Nieuwstraat 7","postal_code":"3512 PA","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.casco.art","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek kunst als een manier om samen te denken en te handelen. Casco verbindt artistieke projecten met vragen over gedeelde ruimte en middelen. Tentoonstellingen en publieke activiteiten maken het onderzoek toegankelijk.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","maatschappij","experiment"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"3530053f-e512-5258-9c49-cb1a82f58d61","inventory_key":"art-audit:z11","name":"CBK Centrum Beeldende Kunst Zuidoost","city":"Amsterdam","province":"Noord-Holland","street_address":"Anton de Komplein 120","postal_code":"1102 DR","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.cbkzuidoost.nl","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontmoet beeldende kunst vanuit Amsterdam-Zuidoost en daarbuiten. CBK Zuidoost geeft uiteenlopende makers ruimte in tentoonstellingen en projecten. Nieuwe stemmen en herkenbare verhalen maken kunst onderdeel van de stad.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","kunsthal","Amsterdam-Zuidoost"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"7253528b-7a0e-568a-8027-0fffa0e48466","inventory_key":"art-audit:z13","name":"Concordia","city":"Enschede","province":"Overijssel","street_address":"Langestraat 56","postal_code":"7500 AK","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.concordia.nl","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek beeldende kunst bij Concordia. Wisselende tentoonstellingen brengen actuele makers en uiteenlopende media naar Enschede. Het programma nodigt uit om samen te kijken, vragen te stellen en nieuwe ideeën te ontdekken.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","kunsthal","mediakunst"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"d57b690e-b2d3-538c-835e-c9c97020b2b2","inventory_key":"art-audit:z18","name":"De Cacaofabriek","city":"Helmond","province":"Noord-Brabant","street_address":"Cacaokade 1","postal_code":"5705 LA","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.cacaofabriek.nl","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek wisselende kunst in een voormalige cacaofabriek. De expositieruimte biedt plaats aan verschillende makers en media. In het bredere cultuurhuis ontmoeten beeldende kunst, film en andere programma''s elkaar.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","kunsthal","fotografie"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"ca2c6fde-1b3e-5017-b7db-24bc9d344a20","inventory_key":"art-audit:z19","name":"De Fabriek Eindhoven","city":"Eindhoven","province":"Noord-Brabant","street_address":"BAARSSTRAAT 38","postal_code":"5615 RG","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.defabriekeindhoven.nl","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Kijk mee waar kunstenaars ideeën ontwikkelen. De Fabriek verbindt residenties met presentaties en experimenten. Materialen, ruimte en samenwerking krijgen steeds een nieuwe rol in deze onafhankelijke plek in Eindhoven.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","experiment","design"],"photos":[{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/De_Fabriek.jpg","caption":"De Fabriek Eindhoven — De Fabriek","credit":"Mander","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:De_Fabriek.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"9ca0e59a-1012-5d5c-aa25-9ea718064b17","inventory_key":"art-audit:z21","name":"Extrapool","city":"Nijmegen","province":"Gelderland","street_address":"Tweede Walstraat 5","postal_code":"6511 LN","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.extrapool.nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek kunst die klinkt, beweegt en van papier springt. Extrapool verbindt geluidskunst, beeld en experimenteel drukwerk. Presentaties en samenwerkingen laten zien hoe makers elkaar kunnen uitdagen tot iets nieuws.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["geluidskunst","drukwerk","experiment"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"4933b0fd-07e5-5856-a1a3-929f6a4ca999","inventory_key":"art-audit:z22","name":"Factor IJ","city":"Amsterdam","province":"Noord-Holland","street_address":"Pampuslaan 11","postal_code":"1087 HP","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.factor-ij.amsterdam/over-ons/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek kunst en design dichtbij het dagelijks leven. Factor IJ combineert tentoonstellingen met een kunstuitleen en ontwerpcollectie. Vooral Amsterdamse makers laten zien hoeveel verschillende vormen eigentijdse verbeelding kan aannemen.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","design","kunsthal"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"a5149a14-e065-56e0-ac24-a33f2fc9b777","inventory_key":"art-audit:z23","name":"FOTODOK","city":"Utrecht","province":"Utrecht","street_address":"Lange Nieuwstraat 7","postal_code":"3512 PA","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.fotodok.org/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek fotografische verhalen met meerdere lagen. FOTODOK presenteert documentaire fotografie en geeft ruimte aan gesprekken over wat beelden vertellen. Tentoonstellingen nodigen uit om langer te kijken naar mensen, plaatsen en gebeurtenissen.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["fotografie","documentaire fotografie","kunsthal"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"bf8db4f9-ca97-5715-a46d-7ec2887dec9f","inventory_key":"wikipedia:Noord-Holland:framerframed:amsterdam","name":"Framer Framed","city":"Amsterdam","province":"Noord-Holland","street_address":"O